{"version":"20261117-open-atlas","entries":{"east_asia:detail:JPN-1863":{"label":{"en":"Aomori Prefecture","zh-CN":"青森县","zh-TW":"青森縣"},"description":{"en":"Aomori Prefecture is a prefecture of Japan in the Tōhoku region. The prefecture's capital, largest city, and namesake is the city of Aomori.","zh-CN":"青森县是日本本州最北部的一个縣，縣廳位於青森市。在令制國的時代屬於陸奧國。","zh-TW":"青森縣是日本本州最北部的一個縣，縣廳位於青森市。在令制國的時代屬於陸奧國。"},"source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aomori_Prefecture","textSources":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aomori_Prefecture","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E6%A3%AE%E7%B8%A3"],"textLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0; shortened encyclopedia extracts","textLicenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","photo":{"src":"assets/maps/regions/photos/9788199fd4705e70.webp","credit":"岩浪陸 · CC BY 3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:An_apple_branch_with_Mount_Iwaki_in_the_background.jpg","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","alt":"Terasawa Shimizutomita, Hirosaki-shi, Aomori-ken 036-8262, Japan","place":"Aomori Prefecture","originalFile":"An_apple_branch_with_Mount_Iwaki_in_the_background.jpg","modifications":"Resized and converted to WebP; no content edits."}}}}
